{
  "title": "RemoteFM1",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "FM-1 firmwares run",
        "on the Move itself:",
        "three at once, each",
        "in its own slot.",
        "",
        "Play them from the",
        "pads, knobs and the",
        "sequencer.",
        "",
        "A phone or computer",
        "on the same Wi-Fi:",
        "remotefm1.local:7730",
        "shows the FM-1's",
        "screen, Mix & FX,",
        "files and more."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Leaving",
      "lines": [
        "Shift + touch the",
        "volume knob + click",
        "the jog wheel.",
        "",
        "Move's own software",
        "starts again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Accessibility",
      "lines": [
        "RemoteFM1 speaks",
        "what the Move shows:",
        "modes, views, slots,",
        "firmwares, knobs",
        "and loads.",
        "",
        "Global Settings",
        "(Track 4 held +",
        "step 2) >",
        "Speech: Off, On, or",
        "Jog (only while you",
        "touch the jog).",
        "",
        "Voice, speed and",
        "volume are",
        "Schwung's settings."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Track Buttons",
      "lines": [
        "Track 1-3: the three",
        "firmware slots:",
        "orange, blue,",
        "yellow.",
        "Track 4: Mixer,",
        "Routing, projects.",
        "",
        "Tap Track 1-3: play",
        "that firmware in",
        "its own layout.",
        "Hold: its menu.",
        "Double tap: the",
        "firmware list;",
        "double tap a pad",
        "there to load it.",
        "",
        "Tap Track 4: Mixer /",
        "Routing. Hold: pad 1",
        "Mixer, pad 2",
        "Routing, steps the",
        "Shift shortcuts.",
        "Double: projects.",
        "",
        "Back closes menus.",
        "",
        "Hold Track 1-3: a",
        "step selects its",
        "track at once.",
        "Double click: solo.",
        "Hold: its routing.",
        "A Track tap blinks",
        "the selected track",
        "on the steps.",
        "Hold Track + volume:",
        "the slot's level."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Layout Menu",
      "lines": [
        "Hold Track 1-3:",
        "top pads: FM-1,",
        "the firmware's own,",
        "Scale, Chroma,",
        "Drum, Octave;",
        "pad 8: latch.",
        "Other pads: scales.",
        "",
        "Steps: the tracks.",
        "Lit: reaches this",
        "firmware. Dark: not.",
        "Blinking: selected.",
        "Purple: solo.",
        "Click: select.",
        "Double click: solo.",
        "Hold: routed / not.",
        "",
        "Jog: root.",
        "Up/Down: octave."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "FM-1 Mode",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Playing",
          "lines": [
            "Pads are the FM-1's",
            "keys. Knob 1 SELECT,",
            "2 PRESET, 3 ALGO,",
            "5-8 the FM-1's",
            "knobs; its buttons.",
            "Volume is MASTER.",
            "",
            "Jog: SELECT; click",
            "for PRESET, ALGO.",
            "Up: the FM-1's SEQ",
            "Down: the next",
            " loaded firmware"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Labels",
          "lines": [
            "Touch a knob: its",
            "name and value.",
            "",
            "Hold a button: what",
            "it does now.",
            "",
            "Touch the jog wheel",
            "and press buttons:",
            "each shows its",
            "label at once.",
            "",
            "Popup size: Global",
            "Settings, knob 4."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Firmwares",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "The Firmware View",
          "lines": [
            "Double tap Track",
            "1-3: its firmwares.",
            "Back: out again.",
            "",
            "Pads pick a firmware",
            "Jog press: load it",
            "Jog turn: its info",
            "Left/Right: banks",
            "Delete: unload"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Lists & Filters",
          "lines": [
            "Step 1: Favorites",
            "Step 2: All",
            "Steps 3-7: category",
            "Steps 8-15: tags",
            "Step 16: Fantasy",
            "",
            "Sample: favorite",
            "Knob 1: pad colour"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Download & Update",
          "lines": [
            "Mute: the catalog.",
            "Step 1: updates",
            "Step 2: not",
            " installed",
            "",
            "Jog press downloads",
            "(Wi-Fi), then loads",
            "it into the track."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Switching Slots",
          "lines": [
            "Tap Track 1-3: play",
            "that slot.",
            "",
            "Down (FM-1 layout):",
            "the next loaded",
            "slot.",
            "",
            "Track 1-3 held +",
            "volume: that slot's",
            "level."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "States",
          "lines": [
            "Track 1-3 held +",
            "pad 7 (top row), or",
            "Loop in the firmware",
            "list: the firmware's",
            "32 states.",
            "",
            "Pad: load a state.",
            "Empty pad: save.",
            "The lit state saves",
            "itself as you play.",
            "",
            "Copy + pad: copy;",
            "then Copy + an",
            "empty pad: paste.",
            "Delete + pad: cut.",
            "",
            "Step 14: New, the",
            "firmware as first",
            "installed.",
            "Undo: back as it",
            "was before New.",
            "",
            "Back: leave."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "FX & Mix",
      "lines": [
        "Your Schwung MIDI FX",
        "and audio FX run",
        "inside RemoteFM1.",
        "",
        "Tap Track 4: the",
        "Mixer; again:",
        "Routing (FX pages).",
        "",
        "Hold an FX pad and",
        "turn the jog: pick",
        "a module. Jog click:",
        "its pages. Back:",
        "out of the pages."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Note Layouts",
      "lines": [
        "Scale, Chroma, Drum",
        "and Octave are the",
        "sequencer: pads play",
        "the selected track,",
        "steps are its steps,",
        "knobs: trigs first.",
        "",
        "Menu: session view.",
        "Play: the sequencer",
        "and clock to every",
        "firmware."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sequencer",
      "lines": [
        "16 tracks, each on",
        "its own MIDI",
        "channel, like Move's",
        "own sequencer.",
        "",
        "A note layout plays",
        "the track selected",
        "for that firmware.",
        "",
        "Sync: INT by",
        "default.",
        "",
        "Loop, Mute: a quick",
        "click sticks, a",
        "hold is momentary.",
        "Copy, Delete: hold",
        "them.",
        "Delete + Play:",
        "clear the clip.",
        "Shift + Loop: Fill.",
        "",
        "A Shift menu stays",
        "until Back. Touch a",
        "knob: its name on",
        "top.",
        "",
        "Jog: knob pages.",
        "TRIG, FM-1, then",
        "the CC banks.",
        "FM-1 page: knobs",
        "are the firmware's.",
        "Jog click there:",
        "Knobs + Keys. Steps",
        "and buttons go to",
        "the firmware too.",
        "Pads stay notes.",
        "Jog click: back.",
        "",
        "Loop page:",
        "Jog: loop length.",
        "The steps show the",
        "last bar's steps.",
        "Two lower pad rows:",
        "last bar's length,",
        "1-16 steps.",
        "Hold a bar + jog:",
        "its notes' length.",
        "Double click a bar:",
        "loop it alone.",
        "Hold a bar + press",
        "another: the range.",
        "",
        "Shift menus:",
        "Jog picks a value.",
        "Jog click edits it.",
        "Click again: done.",
        "Knobs work as well."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Back Shortcuts",
      "lines": [
        "Hold Back, then:",
        "Left: bar 1, or",
        "track 1 in session.",
        "Up: scene 1 in",
        "session view.",
        "Loop: the loop is",
        "the whole clip.",
        "Play: to bar 1.",
        "Never starts or",
        "stops playback.",
        "Delete: close every",
        "open layer.",
        "A quick Back click",
        "closes one layer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Session View",
      "lines": [
        "Shift + Menu in a",
        "note layout. Track",
        "held + Menu in the",
        "FM-1 layout. Back +",
        "Menu anywhere.",
        "Menu: back out.",
        "",
        "Pad columns 1-7 are",
        "tracks, the 8th",
        "launches scenes.",
        "A column has its",
        "slot's colour.",
        "Grey: no slot.",
        "Dim: not reaching",
        "the firmware played.",
        "",
        "Press a clip: plays",
        "at the next bar.",
        "Double click: now.",
        "Green: playing.",
        "White: selected.",
        "Flashing: waiting,",
        "or about to stop.",
        "Empty slot: selects",
        "it, stops the track.",
        "Shift + slot: select",
        "only.",
        "",
        "Scene pad: plays the",
        "row, also from stop.",
        "Double click: now.",
        "Shift + scene: stop.",
        "",
        "Steps: odd selects",
        "the track above,",
        "even stops it.",
        "Step 16: stop all.",
        "Hold an odd step:",
        "knob 1 Launch,",
        "knob 2 After,",
        "volume the level.",
        "",
        "Shift + arrows: a",
        "page.",
        "",
        "Touch a knob: its",
        "track's info. Knob",
        "8: the scenes.",
        "",
        "Tap Track 1-3: that",
        "firmware plays.",
        "Hold Track 1-3: pads",
        "route a column.",
        "Click: on / off.",
        "Double click: solo.",
        "",
        "Hold Delete + clip:",
        "deleted, kept in",
        "the buffer.",
        "Hold Copy + clip:",
        "copied. Empty slot:",
        "pasted. After a",
        "copy or a delete a",
        "clip is replaced.",
        "Scene pads: the",
        "same for a row.",
        "Delete + Play:",
        "clear the clip.",
        "",
        "Global settings,",
        "Launch: when clips",
        "start.",
        "",
        "Double click the",
        "playing clip: it",
        "stops now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Projects",
      "lines": [
        "Track 4 double tap",
        "(or held + step 1):",
        "the 32 projects.",
        "",
        "A project keeps its",
        "three firmwares and",
        "their sounds:",
        "opening it loads",
        "them as you left",
        "them.",
        "",
        "Empty pad: a new",
        "project, its three",
        "slots empty.",
        "",
        "Copy held + a",
        "project, then an",
        "empty pad: a copy",
        "to make a variation.",
        "Delete + project:",
        "cut.",
        "",
        "A firmware that is",
        "not installed: its",
        "slot stays empty."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Arp",
      "lines": [
        "Shift + step 11:",
        "click opens, hold",
        "turns it on / off.",
        "Back closes it.",
        "",
        "Jog click: arp on /",
        "off.",
        "Touch a knob: its",
        "name and value on",
        "top.",
        "",
        "Jog: Mod and",
        "Transpose lanes.",
        "There the 16 steps",
        "are the lane's",
        "steps. Knob 1: what",
        "the step does.",
        "Knob 2: length.",
        "Knob 3: reset.",
        "Hold a step: the",
        "pads choose its",
        "function or",
        "semitones.",
        "Step 1 + a step:",
        "the length.",
        "",
        "Menu: track /",
        "session view under",
        "the arp."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "An FM-1 as Panel",
      "lines": [
        "Plug an FM-1 running",
        "RemoteFM1 into the",
        "Move's USB-A: its",
        "keys, knobs and LEDs",
        "work. Its screen",
        "shows a plug icon.",
        "",
        "With the Wi-Fi build",
        "on the same Wi-Fi",
        "the Move finds it,",
        "screen and all.",
        "",
        "Set up its Wi-Fi on",
        "the page, or on the",
        "FM-1: hold HOME,",
        "the WI-FI row."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "More",
      "lines": [
        "Guide:",
        "remotefm1.com/move",
        "",
        "Source and issues:",
        "github.com/",
        "Quixotic7/",
        "remoteFM14Move"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
